[
 {
  "id": "001",
  "timestamp": "0:00",
  "narration": "Try to tickle yourself. Actually do it.",
  "job_id": "2b8a28cc-93ab-49ec-8a8b-dd0d140d8886",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022145_2b8a28cc-93ab-49ec-8a8b-dd0d140d8886.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "002",
  "timestamp": "0:05",
  "narration": "Run your fingers along the bottom of your foot,",
  "job_id": "c8a04690-8ea8-4908-8335-1332a3d952ed",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022145_c8a04690-8ea8-4908-8335-1332a3d952ed.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "003",
  "timestamp": "0:09",
  "narration": "or the side of your ribs, the spot that makes you squirm when someone else touches it.",
  "job_id": "3e5c6bcb-d570-43eb-b6b3-fe5a0d3465b0",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022146_3e5c6bcb-d570-43eb-b6b3-fe5a0d3465b0.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "004",
  "timestamp": "0:16",
  "narration": "Nothing.",
  "job_id": "4cdb43c5-7471-4883-ad8e-123c5b9c40c7",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022146_4cdb43c5-7471-4883-ad8e-123c5b9c40c7.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "005",
  "timestamp": "0:18",
  "narration": "You can feel your fingers. You can feel exactly where they are and how light they are.",
  "job_id": "2454f125-068f-479d-8aa9-ae2b231f889b",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022146_2454f125-068f-479d-8aa9-ae2b231f889b.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "006",
  "timestamp": "0:25",
  "narration": "It's the same touch, on the same skin, in the same place.",
  "job_id": "7807d64a-672a-48e9-afbd-a4379c70f4e6",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022146_7807d64a-672a-48e9-afbd-a4379c70f4e6.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "007",
  "timestamp": "0:29",
  "narration": "But it doesn't tickle, and no matter how hard you try, it never will.",
  "job_id": "0749059b-4bf6-4046-8c8c-14a66af1b22e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022146_0749059b-4bf6-4046-8c8c-14a66af1b22e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "008",
  "timestamp": "0:35",
  "narration": "That seems like a silly little fact about being human. It isn't.",
  "job_id": "732a90d7-870e-4f03-9acd-c55250110c57",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022145_732a90d7-870e-4f03-9acd-c55250110c57.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "009",
  "timestamp": "0:40",
  "narration": "It's one of the clearest windows we have into how your brain decides what's real, what's you, and what's someone else.",
  "job_id": "223fc0ea-8298-41df-b256-cabecb5e0335",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022146_223fc0ea-8298-41df-b256-cabecb5e0335.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "010",
  "timestamp": "0:48",
  "narration": "When that system breaks, people start hearing voices.",
  "job_id": "bdaa01da-98aa-4f54-83cc-fc87fa340e21",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022146_bdaa01da-98aa-4f54-83cc-fc87fa340e21.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "011",
  "timestamp": "0:53",
  "narration": "People have been stuck on this question for a long time.",
  "job_id": "c2eb506c-4092-4fd2-8b9a-1d982907a9d8",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022305_c2eb506c-4092-4fd2-8b9a-1d982907a9d8.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "012",
  "timestamp": "0:57",
  "narration": "A collection of scientific puzzles attributed to Aristotle, written more than 2,000 years ago, asks it directly:",
  "job_id": "9d42688b-616c-49ae-8ab2-e532f0416820",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022145_9d42688b-616c-49ae-8ab2-e532f0416820.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "013",
  "timestamp": "1:07",
  "narration": "why can't a person tickle himself?",
  "job_id": "88bb62c2-6b02-4288-8eff-fc6dd878fdc6",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022305_88bb62c2-6b02-4288-8eff-fc6dd878fdc6.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "014",
  "timestamp": "1:10",
  "narration": "In 1872, Charles Darwin noticed something important about it.",
  "job_id": "e7b8b0ea-bb22-4942-8c0c-3699fdfd0c38",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022305_e7b8b0ea-bb22-4942-8c0c-3699fdfd0c38.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "015",
  "timestamp": "1:17",
  "narration": "He wrote that for tickling to work, the person being tickled can't know exactly where the touch is going to land.",
  "job_id": "f57f5180-b64f-45ae-9641-d677fdb2dfb0",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022305_f57f5180-b64f-45ae-9641-d677fdb2dfb0.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "016",
  "timestamp": "1:24",
  "narration": "A child, he pointed out, can hardly tickle itself at all.",
  "job_id": "395e1f57-5ded-4203-a03a-c9e00fe873ca",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022305_395e1f57-5ded-4203-a03a-c9e00fe873ca.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "017",
  "timestamp": "1:30",
  "narration": "He was close. But it would take another century, and a machine, to work out what was really going on.",
  "job_id": "9896412f-ba1f-4099-9faf-9975360f1c06",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022305_9896412f-ba1f-4099-9faf-9975360f1c06.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "018",
  "timestamp": "1:39",
  "narration": "In 1971, three researchers at Oxford named Lawrence Weiskrantz, John Elliott and Christine Darlington built a tickling device.",
  "job_id": "a2a93726-e6fc-4e28-b295-806018fdb80f",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022305_a2a93726-e6fc-4e28-b295-806018fdb80f.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "019",
  "timestamp": "1:49",
  "narration": "It was a lever connected to a soft tip that brushed the sole of your foot.",
  "job_id": "0cc88ce8-2e12-4d62-9d30-621bc7d44c44",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022305_0cc88ce8-2e12-4d62-9d30-621bc7d44c44.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "020",
  "timestamp": "1:56",
  "narration": "Sometimes the experimenter worked the lever.",
  "job_id": "428997b3-9612-410d-aa0f-4bd3b4ab861e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022402_428997b3-9612-410d-aa0f-4bd3b4ab861e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "021",
  "timestamp": "2:00",
  "narration": "Sometimes the volunteer did it themselves.",
  "job_id": "9c4f1b0c-8106-48a9-a397-4c4c33666c1e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022404_9c4f1b0c-8106-48a9-a397-4c4c33666c1e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "022",
  "timestamp": "2:05",
  "narration": "When someone else moved it, people rated it as ticklish.",
  "job_id": "045894fb-5d48-408d-bb3c-ac0e11719a7d",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022402_045894fb-5d48-408d-bb3c-ac0e11719a7d.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "023",
  "timestamp": "2:09",
  "narration": "When they moved it themselves, the feeling dropped away.",
  "job_id": "885dfb08-1dc7-42e3-9997-2b29ad3b9fdb",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022402_885dfb08-1dc7-42e3-9997-2b29ad3b9fdb.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "024",
  "timestamp": "2:14",
  "narration": "Then came the strange part.",
  "job_id": "70952554-7c03-480a-95f7-bb9b7b4d3884",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022403_70952554-7c03-480a-95f7-bb9b7b4d3884.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "025",
  "timestamp": "2:16",
  "narration": "When the volunteer just rested their hand on the lever while the experimenter moved it, so their hand went along for the ride without making the movement,",
  "job_id": "c4c02352-4209-423b-b738-2604e8c53913",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022403_c4c02352-4209-423b-b738-2604e8c53913.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "026",
  "timestamp": "2:28",
  "narration": "it landed somewhere in between.",
  "job_id": "9e1ce287-3853-4ad1-b66f-611969fb01bd",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022403_9e1ce287-3853-4ad1-b66f-611969fb01bd.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "027",
  "timestamp": "2:31",
  "narration": "So it wasn't about whose hand was touching you. It was about who decided to move.",
  "job_id": "29fdb0be-51ab-48a6-827d-d04b334f122c",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022402_29fdb0be-51ab-48a6-827d-d04b334f122c.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "028",
  "timestamp": "2:39",
  "narration": "To understand why, you have to know about a message your brain sends every time you do anything.",
  "job_id": "f48e0d64-a53c-40d4-9ad4-e44edb47de18",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022503_f48e0d64-a53c-40d4-9ad4-e44edb47de18.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "029",
  "timestamp": "2:47",
  "narration": "Try this. Close one eye, and with your fingertip, very gently press on the side of your other eyelid. Just a light nudge.",
  "job_id": "e8a14487-e335-4df5-86c0-0626b4e06e50",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022503_e8a14487-e335-4df5-86c0-0626b4e06e50.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "030",
  "timestamp": "2:59",
  "narration": "The world moves. The whole room jumps.",
  "job_id": "c71617d4-5213-4f1d-a0a9-d9196ae5aa0e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022504_c71617d4-5213-4f1d-a0a9-d9196ae5aa0e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "031",
  "timestamp": "3:03",
  "narration": "Now move your eye normally. Look left, then right.",
  "job_id": "d254e31d-6bff-4909-baf4-c24bcad73fa6",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022503_d254e31d-6bff-4909-baf4-c24bcad73fa6.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "032",
  "timestamp": "3:10",
  "narration": "The room stays perfectly still.",
  "job_id": "51e749f8-233e-4e15-920f-7589da30533b",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022503_51e749f8-233e-4e15-920f-7589da30533b.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "033",
  "timestamp": "3:14",
  "narration": "Your eye moved both times, and the image on the back of it shifted both times.",
  "job_id": "c46cb4f1-8387-45fb-9a4a-88abec0d7a2b",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022503_c46cb4f1-8387-45fb-9a4a-88abec0d7a2b.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "034",
  "timestamp": "3:20",
  "narration": "But only one of those made the world lurch.",
  "job_id": "3420e9ad-79cd-42b6-8ad9-632f1d84a22e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022503_3420e9ad-79cd-42b6-8ad9-632f1d84a22e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "035",
  "timestamp": "3:23",
  "narration": "The difference is that when you move your eye on purpose, your brain sends a copy of the command to itself,",
  "job_id": "80547163-6fac-43db-ab19-a74303914557",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022503_80547163-6fac-43db-ab19-a74303914557.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "036",
  "timestamp": "3:31",
  "narration": "a note that says I'm about to move, so expect everything to shift by this much.",
  "job_id": "f73f955a-d495-403d-905e-2fa538de9bd5",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022609_f73f955a-d495-403d-905e-2fa538de9bd5.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "037",
  "timestamp": "3:37",
  "narration": "When the shift arrives, it matches the prediction and gets cancelled out. You never notice.",
  "job_id": "dd862c97-d8fe-4f96-a69a-dc9a8ac2bccc",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022609_dd862c97-d8fe-4f96-a69a-dc9a8ac2bccc.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "038",
  "timestamp": "3:46",
  "narration": "When you push your eye with your finger, no note was sent.",
  "job_id": "d0e0bf5b-f38a-4019-ad1c-c12b9e5ec708",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022609_d0e0bf5b-f38a-4019-ad1c-c12b9e5ec708.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "039",
  "timestamp": "3:50",
  "narration": "The movement arrives unannounced, so your brain assumes it wasn't you. It must have been the world.",
  "job_id": "db2c500b-2296-4c9a-9562-b17d49b449aa",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022609_db2c500b-2296-4c9a-9562-b17d49b449aa.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "040",
  "timestamp": "3:59",
  "narration": "Scientists call that internal note an efference copy.",
  "job_id": "5d03717a-f784-4a9a-a331-b3114f603043",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022609_5d03717a-f784-4a9a-a331-b3114f603043.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "041",
  "timestamp": "4:03",
  "narration": "Two German researchers, Erich von Holst and Horst Mittelstaedt, described it in 1950,",
  "job_id": "28873968-86dd-4a59-a95d-cdf7e50377df",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022609_28873968-86dd-4a59-a95d-cdf7e50377df.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "042",
  "timestamp": "4:10",
  "narration": "and the same year an American named Roger Sperry landed on the same idea independently.",
  "job_id": "99aee78f-289a-436b-a7ac-068af2c02d5f",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022609_99aee78f-289a-436b-a7ac-068af2c02d5f.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "043",
  "timestamp": "4:18",
  "narration": "Nearly everything with a nervous system seems to have some version of it.",
  "job_id": "0f792265-ba88-4252-8529-2f99a27377f7",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022609_0f792265-ba88-4252-8529-2f99a27377f7.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "044",
  "timestamp": "4:25",
  "narration": "A male cricket chirps at around 100 decibels, loud enough to damage its own hearing.",
  "job_id": "88af6324-6aa5-463e-ba90-23e2b66606ff",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022715_88af6324-6aa5-463e-ba90-23e2b66606ff.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "045",
  "timestamp": "4:32",
  "narration": "It doesn't go deaf, because every time it chirps, its nervous system sends a signal that quiets its own ears at exactly that moment.",
  "job_id": "ee7d6b30-05ac-4068-b076-bc716ed3e43a",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022715_ee7d6b30-05ac-4068-b076-bc716ed3e43a.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "046",
  "timestamp": "4:42",
  "narration": "In 2006, researchers Berthold Hedwig and James Poulet recorded that signal firing in perfect rhythm with the chirp.",
  "job_id": "40debe7e-77e6-4f8b-a899-cd8ebd016944",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022715_40debe7e-77e6-4f8b-a899-cd8ebd016944.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "047",
  "timestamp": "4:51",
  "narration": "The cricket is silencing itself so it can still hear everything else.",
  "job_id": "4206fad9-b84d-4b49-9911-f6ade8b9446e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022715_4206fad9-b84d-4b49-9911-f6ade8b9446e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "048",
  "timestamp": "4:57",
  "narration": "You do the same thing with touch.",
  "job_id": "09b3bb86-fc00-46d5-af1d-600d5685eeb1",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022715_09b3bb86-fc00-46d5-af1d-600d5685eeb1.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "049",
  "timestamp": "5:00",
  "narration": "When you move your fingers toward your ribs, your brain already knows what's coming: the timing, the pressure, the exact path.",
  "job_id": "a509a24c-bee7-42c1-af90-7e6c52934421",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022715_a509a24c-bee7-42c1-af90-7e6c52934421.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "050",
  "timestamp": "5:09",
  "narration": "The prediction arrives before the sensation does, and the sensation gets turned down.",
  "job_id": "1338d44e-7711-4a7b-8c73-96f2f0387833",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022715_1338d44e-7711-4a7b-8c73-96f2f0387833.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "051",
  "timestamp": "5:16",
  "narration": "Tickling is what happens when touch arrives that your brain didn't predict.",
  "job_id": "8530a8f9-466e-47a8-9b66-c234499bd269",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022715_8530a8f9-466e-47a8-9b66-c234499bd269.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "052",
  "timestamp": "5:22",
  "narration": "It's the feeling of something else touching you.",
  "job_id": "7945a5fd-e444-4160-a508-38307f6e5f71",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022809_7945a5fd-e444-4160-a508-38307f6e5f71.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "053",
  "timestamp": "5:25",
  "narration": "You can't surprise yourself, so you can't tickle yourself.",
  "job_id": "45fc2b0b-b62a-4649-a72d-62f2a9529b1f",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022810_45fc2b0b-b62a-4649-a72d-62f2a9529b1f.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "054",
  "timestamp": "5:30",
  "narration": "In the late 1990s, a team in London set out to prove it.",
  "job_id": "4eb658b4-51ba-4b57-bd87-9f09fc83571c",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022809_4eb658b4-51ba-4b57-bd87-9f09fc83571c.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "055",
  "timestamp": "5:36",
  "narration": "Sarah-Jayne Blakemore, Daniel Wolpert and Chris Frith built a setup with two robot arms.",
  "job_id": "b06f14c2-e525-44b5-9d0e-dc490ea3e6e1",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022809_b06f14c2-e525-44b5-9d0e-dc490ea3e6e1.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "056",
  "timestamp": "5:42",
  "narration": "The volunteer moved one arm with their left hand.",
  "job_id": "7d571ba2-6ed8-4d85-8571-88cfa49346ea",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022809_7d571ba2-6ed8-4d85-8571-88cfa49346ea.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "057",
  "timestamp": "5:46",
  "narration": "That movement was sent to a second robot, which stroked a piece of soft foam across the palm of their right hand.",
  "job_id": "f9d65b55-025b-440a-909a-1735aa97cd30",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022809_f9d65b55-025b-440a-909a-1735aa97cd30.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "058",
  "timestamp": "5:55",
  "narration": "You're tickling yourself, just through a robot. And like always, it barely tickled.",
  "job_id": "6294ed0e-c726-4b86-86a8-9d7720467e61",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022809_6294ed0e-c726-4b86-86a8-9d7720467e61.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "059",
  "timestamp": "6:02",
  "narration": "Then the researchers started adding delays.",
  "job_id": "7b46c0ef-1280-46f4-9a62-ed44060825b3",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022858_7b46c0ef-1280-46f4-9a62-ed44060825b3.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "060",
  "timestamp": "6:06",
  "narration": "A tenth of a second between your movement and the touch. Then two tenths. Then three.",
  "job_id": "2cafb46f-e5c3-4c00-99cc-a76fcaa9c03f",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022858_2cafb46f-e5c3-4c00-99cc-a76fcaa9c03f.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "061",
  "timestamp": "6:13",
  "narration": "The longer the delay, the more it tickled.",
  "job_id": "28a8c2ba-2c20-4428-a18a-4af4d8f38cba",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022858_28a8c2ba-2c20-4428-a18a-4af4d8f38cba.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "062",
  "timestamp": "6:18",
  "narration": "They tried something else. Instead of delaying the touch, they rotated it, so when you moved the stick one direction, the foam moved at an angle.",
  "job_id": "5296cd1f-1d9b-4d55-b0fd-d3c3f9f6c533",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022858_5296cd1f-1d9b-4d55-b0fd-d3c3f9f6c533.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "063",
  "timestamp": "6:29",
  "narration": "The bigger the angle, the more it tickled.",
  "job_id": "ddd4ff4b-4f53-470c-8d60-25654ea720ae",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022858_ddd4ff4b-4f53-470c-8d60-25654ea720ae.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "064",
  "timestamp": "6:33",
  "narration": "Nothing about the touch itself had changed, and the volunteer was still the one causing it.",
  "job_id": "89c46cdf-d9c9-4530-977a-6f1d8b432565",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022858_89c46cdf-d9c9-4530-977a-6f1d8b432565.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "065",
  "timestamp": "6:40",
  "narration": "All the researchers did was make the touch slightly different from what the brain predicted.",
  "job_id": "d4ebe24b-4c1f-4924-aab2-661b022ce53b",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022953_d4ebe24b-4c1f-4924-aab2-661b022ce53b.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "066",
  "timestamp": "6:47",
  "narration": "A few hundred milliseconds, a few degrees off, and suddenly it felt like someone else.",
  "job_id": "7b43544a-765d-4af1-965d-c4562a0ed1ea",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022952_7b43544a-765d-4af1-965d-c4562a0ed1ea.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "067",
  "timestamp": "6:55",
  "narration": "When they scanned people's brains during self-touch, they found the areas that process touch were measurably quieter when the touch was self-made.",
  "job_id": "e28c6d82-592d-4f09-a702-327be7605538",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022952_e28c6d82-592d-4f09-a702-327be7605538.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "068",
  "timestamp": "7:04",
  "narration": "The cerebellum, a region at the back of the brain that helps predict the results of your movements,",
  "job_id": "7337d85b-8a24-4c27-8557-86150a011529",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022953_7337d85b-8a24-4c27-8557-86150a011529.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "069",
  "timestamp": "7:12",
  "narration": "seemed to be sending the signal to turn it down.",
  "job_id": "82d3b6a5-7a7f-4638-8388-f8072030bc08",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022952_82d3b6a5-7a7f-4638-8388-f8072030bc08.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "070",
  "timestamp": "7:16",
  "narration": "So your brain isn't just feeling the world. It's constantly subtracting you from it,",
  "job_id": "b8c9525c-ee25-40fd-9eb5-61de9394d278",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022952_b8c9525c-ee25-40fd-9eb5-61de9394d278.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "071",
  "timestamp": "7:22",
  "narration": "filtering out every sensation you cause so that whatever's left over, whatever it didn't see coming, stands out.",
  "job_id": "4b09f336-a147-43e0-963f-18481c2886c0",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_022952_4b09f336-a147-43e0-963f-18481c2886c0.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "072",
  "timestamp": "7:31",
  "narration": "That leftover is how you know something else is there.",
  "job_id": "37043304-184c-43ee-bf92-98334fbdf6f8",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023054_37043304-184c-43ee-bf92-98334fbdf6f8.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "073",
  "timestamp": "7:36",
  "narration": "That filter has a cost, and you've probably felt it.",
  "job_id": "b65a7850-f569-4d24-83f7-acc0b2ba9ea9",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023054_b65a7850-f569-4d24-83f7-acc0b2ba9ea9.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "074",
  "timestamp": "7:41",
  "narration": "In 2003, a team in London, including Wolpert and Frith, sat pairs of people across from each other.",
  "job_id": "a925462c-5da6-49a4-92f8-db91b031ccc9",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023053_a925462c-5da6-49a4-92f8-db91b031ccc9.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "075",
  "timestamp": "7:50",
  "narration": "Each person had a finger resting under a small lever.",
  "job_id": "f0bf0381-f431-4d52-b608-4b9f1378bb38",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023054_f0bf0381-f431-4d52-b608-4b9f1378bb38.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "076",
  "timestamp": "7:54",
  "narration": "Person one pressed down on the other's finger. Person two was told to press back with exactly the same force.",
  "job_id": "9c7701c8-c3e8-4e85-aed7-ee54c1791865",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023054_9c7701c8-c3e8-4e85-aed7-ee54c1791865.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "077",
  "timestamp": "8:02",
  "narration": "Then person one was told to match that, and so on, back and forth.",
  "job_id": "0af7859b-48d1-4959-9d8d-5fd1a16f0dd6",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023054_0af7859b-48d1-4959-9d8d-5fd1a16f0dd6.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "078",
  "timestamp": "8:08",
  "narration": "Everyone was trying to be fair. Everyone was trying to match.",
  "job_id": "06977dbe-98ef-4c8f-9295-d99aae9aee90",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023054_06977dbe-98ef-4c8f-9295-d99aae9aee90.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "079",
  "timestamp": "8:13",
  "narration": "But the force went up about 38% with every turn.",
  "job_id": "03b4baab-bae2-47af-9a1d-550979802f88",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023054_03b4baab-bae2-47af-9a1d-550979802f88.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "080",
  "timestamp": "8:18",
  "narration": "Within a few rounds they were pressing down roughly 20 times harder than where they started.",
  "job_id": "44538b1e-2cc0-458d-8eea-7cfb50a730ef",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023147_44538b1e-2cc0-458d-8eea-7cfb50a730ef.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "081",
  "timestamp": "8:25",
  "narration": "The reason is the same filter. When you press on someone else, your brain predicts your own force and turns down how it feels to you.",
  "job_id": "37a5a41a-cbc2-4014-831f-81ce289d067e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023147_37a5a41a-cbc2-4014-831f-81ce289d067e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "082",
  "timestamp": "8:35",
  "narration": "So your own push always feels softer than it really is, and theirs always feels harder.",
  "job_id": "3dc4b2c2-a81c-4f32-87cc-46832fda40ae",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023147_3dc4b2c2-a81c-4f32-87cc-46832fda40ae.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "083",
  "timestamp": "8:41",
  "narration": "Each person, honestly trying to match, hits back harder than they were hit.",
  "job_id": "8b7ccb86-91a3-4f00-8be2-6d543c421e71",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023147_8b7ccb86-91a3-4f00-8be2-6d543c421e71.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "084",
  "timestamp": "8:47",
  "narration": "The researchers titled their paper Two Eyes for an Eye.",
  "job_id": "63e3cba5-69c6-4b69-8c1d-2951862d0287",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023147_63e3cba5-69c6-4b69-8c1d-2951862d0287.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "085",
  "timestamp": "8:51",
  "narration": "It's a pretty good explanation of every argument you've had that got worse than it needed to be.",
  "job_id": "1209be52-6149-46fe-989a-61fcde6121bd",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023148_1209be52-6149-46fe-989a-61fcde6121bd.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "086",
  "timestamp": "8:59",
  "narration": "\"I only pushed back as hard as you pushed me.\" Both of you believe it, and both of you are wrong.",
  "job_id": "b6f1612e-222b-4158-9455-fe05a3f21f56",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023147_b6f1612e-222b-4158-9455-fe05a3f21f56.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "087",
  "timestamp": "9:08",
  "narration": "It gets darker from here.",
  "job_id": "955a721e-6a3e-4cef-a0ed-41d536445785",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023147_955a721e-6a3e-4cef-a0ed-41d536445785.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "088",
  "timestamp": "9:11",
  "narration": "If your brain labels everything you do as me and everything else as not me,",
  "job_id": "cf932925-60b4-4243-a4ec-24427451b63f",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023244_cf932925-60b4-4243-a4ec-24427451b63f.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "089",
  "timestamp": "9:18",
  "narration": "what happens when the label stops working?",
  "job_id": "70e50307-23f8-40a2-983b-f48ea11a475e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023244_70e50307-23f8-40a2-983b-f48ea11a475e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "090",
  "timestamp": "9:22",
  "narration": "Chris Frith, one of the researchers behind the robot study, spent much of his career on schizophrenia.",
  "job_id": "a6b98239-9552-495d-97ab-6f224c6424aa",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023244_a6b98239-9552-495d-97ab-6f224c6424aa.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "091",
  "timestamp": "9:29",
  "narration": "He noticed something about two of its most common symptoms.",
  "job_id": "c72bdce6-4ce1-4ecf-9d65-fea508d6a514",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023244_c72bdce6-4ce1-4ecf-9d65-fea508d6a514.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "092",
  "timestamp": "9:34",
  "narration": "Many people with schizophrenia hear voices,",
  "job_id": "456a75f0-3b81-4bc1-8b50-1851d0a59095",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023244_456a75f0-3b81-4bc1-8b50-1851d0a59095.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "093",
  "timestamp": "9:38",
  "narration": "and many also report something called passivity experiences, a feeling that their movements are being controlled by an outside force,",
  "job_id": "3939385b-b0a4-4cdb-8630-81b77771cb29",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023324_3939385b-b0a4-4cdb-8630-81b77771cb29.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "094",
  "timestamp": "9:49",
  "narration": "that someone else is moving their arm.",
  "job_id": "79e4d2b2-9167-455d-871f-5af08f3bb41b",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023244_79e4d2b2-9167-455d-871f-5af08f3bb41b.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "095",
  "timestamp": "9:53",
  "narration": "Frith wondered if both of those could come from the same broken tag.",
  "job_id": "f97e494c-e496-4ea1-8086-32b771376c2a",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023244_f97e494c-e496-4ea1-8086-32b771376c2a.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "096",
  "timestamp": "9:57",
  "narration": "What if your own actions arrived without the note that says this was you?",
  "job_id": "8eea333c-b299-4bc4-a75c-63cbaed38c73",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023324_8eea333c-b299-4bc4-a75c-63cbaed38c73.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "097",
  "timestamp": "10:03",
  "narration": "In 2000, Blakemore and Frith ran the tickle test on people with schizophrenia.",
  "job_id": "fe7aa627-1761-46ea-b0eb-c69e93469e84",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023324_fe7aa627-1761-46ea-b0eb-c69e93469e84.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "098",
  "timestamp": "10:10",
  "narration": "Healthy volunteers rated self-touch as much less ticklish than touch from the experimenter.",
  "job_id": "c8b9d469-f72b-4e94-abea-82f1a7577c4c",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023405_c8b9d469-f72b-4e94-abea-82f1a7577c4c.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "099",
  "timestamp": "10:17",
  "narration": "But the patients who heard voices, or felt their bodies being controlled, rated both about the same.",
  "job_id": "c27c1348-8476-488b-a7e3-6d473f55f0d8",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023405_c27c1348-8476-488b-a7e3-6d473f55f0d8.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "100",
  "timestamp": "10:25",
  "narration": "They could tickle themselves.",
  "job_id": "8aad635c-e208-47a4-afee-386104587170",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023404_8aad635c-e208-47a4-afee-386104587170.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "101",
  "timestamp": "10:29",
  "narration": "To their brains, their own touch felt just as foreign as a stranger's.",
  "job_id": "8d0a66a1-a070-4813-8bc2-db9405944548",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023405_8d0a66a1-a070-4813-8bc2-db9405944548.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "102",
  "timestamp": "10:34",
  "narration": "Now think about what that means for your inner voice.",
  "job_id": "e2131006-6ebf-46f2-8e86-ff456c5c2492",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023404_e2131006-6ebf-46f2-8e86-ff456c5c2492.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "103",
  "timestamp": "10:38",
  "narration": "You're talking to yourself right now, reading these words in your head.",
  "job_id": "7a59b5b9-f6aa-4eb4-8da1-af99ba6a7d57",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023443_7a59b5b9-f6aa-4eb4-8da1-af99ba6a7d57.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "104",
  "timestamp": "10:42",
  "narration": "There's evidence the brain uses a similar prediction to mark that voice as yours, quieting its response to your own speech the way it quiets your own touch.",
  "job_id": "de3e0b02-19b0-4445-9faa-c49481d76e5e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023443_de3e0b02-19b0-4445-9faa-c49481d76e5e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "105",
  "timestamp": "10:53",
  "narration": "If that mark fails, your own thoughts could arrive sounding like they came from somewhere else.",
  "job_id": "85c76333-c2cf-470d-a18d-b100e4f2c00e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023443_85c76333-c2cf-470d-a18d-b100e4f2c00e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "106",
  "timestamp": "10:59",
  "narration": "Not imagined voices. Your voice, with the \"me\" label torn off.",
  "job_id": "c27fff89-fe55-4610-9f89-56b6354d4a5c",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023443_c27fff89-fe55-4610-9f89-56b6354d4a5c.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "107",
  "timestamp": "11:06",
  "narration": "The line between you and not-you isn't something you're born knowing.",
  "job_id": "a7b6b5f8-25eb-4261-aac4-4ae6ce5f284c",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023520_a7b6b5f8-25eb-4261-aac4-4ae6ce5f284c.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "108",
  "timestamp": "11:10",
  "narration": "It's something your brain calculates, moment by moment, out of predictions.",
  "job_id": "0813f047-681d-4399-9a5f-340fc851fde4",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023520_0813f047-681d-4399-9a5f-340fc851fde4.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "109",
  "timestamp": "11:17",
  "narration": "Most of the time it gets it right, so perfectly you never think about it.",
  "job_id": "a3802e32-e815-437d-98a6-41a968b5563a",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023520_a3802e32-e815-437d-98a6-41a968b5563a.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "110",
  "timestamp": "11:22",
  "narration": "But it's a calculation, and calculations can go wrong.",
  "job_id": "86a569b4-a4c2-4a41-82ef-41fdacb827af",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023520_86a569b4-a4c2-4a41-82ef-41fdacb827af.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "111",
  "timestamp": "11:28",
  "narration": "That brings us back to the tickle.",
  "job_id": "5e4e870e-024c-4e17-a16f-0895545c45a8",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023559_5e4e870e-024c-4e17-a16f-0895545c45a8.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "112",
  "timestamp": "11:31",
  "narration": "There's a reason tickling seems to exist at all.",
  "job_id": "6d33a676-9a1e-49d3-8fbd-3216bb5ef458",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023559_6d33a676-9a1e-49d3-8fbd-3216bb5ef458.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "113",
  "timestamp": "11:35",
  "narration": "It shows up almost entirely between people: parents and babies, siblings, friends.",
  "job_id": "f77eda76-2520-431a-a01d-ecaa17a4f324",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023559_f77eda76-2520-431a-a01d-ecaa17a4f324.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "114",
  "timestamp": "11:42",
  "narration": "In the late 1990s, the neuroscientist Jaak Panksepp found that rats make ultrasonic chirps when you tickle them,",
  "job_id": "943ad4d2-968b-4e92-8938-7232f5eabbea",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023559_943ad4d2-968b-4e92-8938-7232f5eabbea.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "115",
  "timestamp": "11:51",
  "narration": "a kind of laughter too high for us to hear,",
  "job_id": "06a7eeb6-573e-405c-953e-3899c9501f99",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023636_06a7eeb6-573e-405c-953e-3899c9501f99.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "116",
  "timestamp": "11:54",
  "narration": "and they'd chase a researcher's hand to get more.",
  "job_id": "2ffafc10-7dce-4e41-b09e-bdbdd7638d58",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023636_2ffafc10-7dce-4e41-b09e-bdbdd7638d58.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "117",
  "timestamp": "11:58",
  "narration": "It's one of the first forms of play there is.",
  "job_id": "1a5d7613-0f69-4965-ba38-fb331c6740f4",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023636_1a5d7613-0f69-4965-ba38-fb331c6740f4.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "118",
  "timestamp": "12:01",
  "narration": "Tickling might be the earliest way a brain learns that there's someone else out there.",
  "job_id": "fd506fab-0ecd-457e-bf5f-b118d1dbca22",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023636_fd506fab-0ecd-457e-bf5f-b118d1dbca22.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "119",
  "timestamp": "12:07",
  "narration": "A touch you didn't predict, from a person you can't control, that makes you laugh anyway.",
  "job_id": "834e642e-254a-41fe-a2c2-c2821539ac81",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023719_834e642e-254a-41fe-a2c2-c2821539ac81.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "120",
  "timestamp": "12:15",
  "narration": "So try it one more time. Your fingers on your ribs.",
  "job_id": "e50b68a0-5fce-4ed6-b35d-40f44462198e",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023719_e50b68a0-5fce-4ed6-b35d-40f44462198e.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "121",
  "timestamp": "12:20",
  "narration": "You feel them, and your brain feels them coming, cancels them out",
  "job_id": "a3f3fd8b-4551-4e67-9856-22b0c11471ce",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023720_a3f3fd8b-4551-4e67-9856-22b0c11471ce.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "122",
  "timestamp": "12:24",
  "narration": "and quietly signs its name at the bottom: this was you.",
  "job_id": "fbb0616e-4cb4-460b-944d-5b25aeb15932",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023719_fbb0616e-4cb4-460b-944d-5b25aeb15932.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "123",
  "timestamp": "12:29",
  "narration": "That's why it doesn't work.",
  "job_id": "5774c512-157e-4a2f-af2b-ea1998add974",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023719_5774c512-157e-4a2f-af2b-ea1998add974.png"
 },
 {
  "id": "124",
  "timestamp": "12:31",
  "narration": "Out of every sensation you'll ever have, the tickle is the one that needs someone else to be there.",
  "job_id": "41ef33c5-5153-4abe-8bac-7c60363bdb6c",
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JnhQwrBEKeiRB9kwtEe0sp8znc/hf_20260930_023719_41ef33c5-5153-4abe-8bac-7c60363bdb6c.png"
 }
]